title: "tpt-engineering"
abstract: >-
  Small, single-purpose Rust crates for physical-systems engineering: fluid
  properties (IAPWS-IF97, ASHRAE psychrometrics), time-series conditioning,
  topology, controls, structural analysis, tolerancing, reliability, geometry
  and CAD primitives, and domain component models.
